title: 'Registrar: scaffolding for the remaining para lifecycle calls'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      Lays out the protocol for the registrar calls that are not implemented yet. The message
      types, call signatures and response routing are in place; the bodies are `todo!()` and land
      in follow-ups.

crates:
